# Color vocabulary

Follow `AGENTS.md`. Two rules, always:

## 1. Never remove Storybook legacy aliases

Do not delete, empty, or hide the **Legacy aliases** section on Foundations → Colors.

Marker in code: `DO_NOT_REMOVE_LEGACY_ALIASES`

Must keep:

- `legacyAliasColors` in `apps/storybook/stories/foundations/token-data.ts`
- The "Legacy aliases" `TokenSection` in `apps/storybook/stories/foundations/colors.stories.tsx`
- CSS aliases in `packages/ui/src/styles/tokens.css` and `theme.css`

## 2. New vocabulary in components

New or edited UI must use Tier 2 classes, not legacy shadcn names and not raw palettes.

```tsx
// ❌ BAD
<button className="bg-primary text-primary-foreground" />
<button className="bg-purple-600 text-white" />

// ✅ GOOD
<button className="bg-action-primary text-action-primary-fg" />
```

```tsx
// ❌ BAD
<p className="text-muted-foreground" />
<p className="text-slate-500" />

// ✅ GOOD
<p className="text-fg-tertiary" />
```

| Use | Not |
|---|---|
| `text-fg-primary` | `text-foreground` |
| `bg-canvas` | `bg-background` |
| `bg-surface` | `bg-card` |
| `bg-action-primary` | `bg-primary` |
| `border-border-default` | `border-border` |
